{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Therefore it is said.</b> Concerning this encampment and the miracles that were done in it — <b>it is said in the book of the wars of YHWH</b>: when they recount the miracles that were done for our fathers, they recount אֶת וָהֵב and so forth." "<b>אֶת וָהֵב.</b> Like אֶת יָהֵב — just as one says from יעד וָעֵד, so one says from יהב וָהֵב, and the vav is a root letter — that is, אֶת אֲשֶׁר יָהַב לָהֶם, and He multiplied miracles at the Sea of Reeds." "<b>And the wadis of Arnon.</b> Just as they recount the miracles of the Sea of Reeds, so there is to recount the miracles of the wadis of Arnon, for here too great miracles were done. And what are the miracles?"], :book :numbers, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:11:56.204855790Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}